Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"bigquery__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Dataplex 自动采集列级血缘，Data Catalog 统一发现 官方文档。 血缘覆盖查询/作业全链路 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Dataplex 自动采集列级血缘，Data Catalog 统一发现 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>血缘覆盖查询/作业全链路 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Dataplex column-level lineage + Catalog; benchmark). Dataplex auto-captures column-level lineage; Data Catalog unifies discovery <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Lineage spans…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Dataplex column-level lineage + Catalog; benchmark).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dataplex auto-captures column-level lineage; Data Catalog unifies discovery <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Lineage spans queries and jobs end to end <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">时间旅行：默认 7 天，可查询表的历史版本、恢复误删数据 官方文档。 故障安全期（fail-safe）：时间旅行窗口之外再加 7 天（Google 侧保留，需走支持恢复）官方文档。 表快照、数据集复制、跨区域数据集复制做容灾与归档 官方文档。 注意：7 天窗口比 Snowflake（企业版 90 天）短得多，长期审计/合规归档要靠快照或导…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>时间旅行：默认 7 天，可查询表的历史版本、恢复误删数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>故障安全期（fail-safe）：时间旅行窗口之外再加 7 天（Google 侧保留，需走支持恢复）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>表快照、数据集复制、跨区域数据集复制做容灾与归档 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：7 天窗口比 Snowflake（企业版 90 天）短得多，长期审计/合规归档要靠快照或导出到 GCS，不能依赖时间旅行 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (7-day time travel + snapshots + cross-region copy). Time travel: 7 days by default — query historical table versions, recover from accidental deletes (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (7-day time travel + snapshots + cross-region copy).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time travel: 7 days by default — query historical table versions, recover from accidental deletes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Fail-safe: an additional 7 days beyond the time-travel window (Google-side retention, recovery via support) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Table snapshots, dataset copy and cross-region dataset copy for DR and archiving <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: the 7-day window is far shorter than Snowflake&#x27;s (90 days on Enterprise) — long-horizon audit/compliance archiving must rely on snapshots or GCS exports, not time travel <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Colossus 分布式存储 + Dremel 计算，存算分离的开创者 官方文档。 计算资源按 slot 弹性，与存储完全解耦 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Colossus 分布式存储 + Dremel 计算，存算分离的开创者 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计算资源按 slot 弹性，与存储完全解耦 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Disaggregation pioneer: Colossus + Dremel). Colossus distributed storage + Dremel compute; the disaggregation pioneer <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Compute scales in slots,…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Disaggregation pioneer: Colossus + Dremel).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Colossus distributed storage + Dremel compute; the disaggregation pioneer <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Compute scales in slots, fully decoupled from storage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">JSON、GEOGRAPHY、BigQuery ML，VECTOR_SEARCH 有限支持 官方文档。 无原生全文/图引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>JSON、GEOGRAPHY、BigQuery ML，VECTOR_SEARCH 有限支持 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生全文/图引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (JSON + GEOGRAPHY + ML; limited vectors). JSON, GEOGRAPHY, BigQuery ML, and limited VECTOR_SEARCH <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native full-text/graph engine (community con…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (JSON + GEOGRAPHY + ML; limited vectors).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON, GEOGRAPHY, BigQuery ML, and limited VECTOR_SEARCH <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native full-text/graph engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">dry run 可预估查询扫描量再执行，是成本可观测的标杆实践。官方文档 INFORMATION_SCHEMA 按作业/用户归因 slot 与字节用量，custom quotas 限流，预算告警完整。官方文档 账单可导出 BigQuery 做细粒度 FinOps 分析。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>dry run 可预估查询扫描量再执行，是成本可观测的标杆实践。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>INFORMATION_SCHEMA 按作业/用户归因 slot 与字节用量，custom quotas 限流，预算告警完整。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>账单可导出 BigQuery 做细粒度 FinOps 分析。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Benchmark: dry run, quotas, alerts). Dry run estimates bytes scanned before execution: a benchmark FinOps practice. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> INFORMATION_SCHEMA attribut…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Benchmark: dry run, quotas, alerts).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dry run estimates bytes scanned before execution: a benchmark FinOps practice. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>INFORMATION_SCHEMA attributes slot and byte usage by job/user; custom quotas throttle spend, with full budget alerting. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Billing exports to BigQuery for fine-grained FinOps analysis. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方 Python/Java/Node/Go 客户端库 + REST API 官方文档。 JDBC/ODBC 靠 Simba 官方合作驱动 官方文档。 dbt 等数仓工具链完备 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方 Python/Java/Node/Go 客户端库 + REST API <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC 靠 Simba 官方合作驱动 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>dbt 等数仓工具链完备 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Official multi-language libs; JDBC/ODBC via Simba). Official Python/Java/Node/Go client libraries plus REST API <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. JDBC/ODBC via official Simba-p…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Official multi-language libs; JDBC/ODBC via Simba).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official Python/Java/Node/Go client libraries plus REST API <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC via official Simba-partnered drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Complete dbt-era warehouse toolchain <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">物化视图增量刷新、查询自动改写 官方文档。 需基表分区对齐等前提，不满足则不增量 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>物化视图增量刷新、查询自动改写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>需基表分区对齐等前提，不满足则不增量 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Incremental + rewrite; needs alignment). Incremental refresh and automatic rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Requires partition alignment etc.; otherwise no incremental…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Incremental + rewrite; needs alignment).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Incremental refresh and automatic rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Requires partition alignment etc.; otherwise no incremental <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（GCP 绑定，无跨云）</span><p class=\"snippet\">仅 GCP，无其他云版本 官方文档。 跨云用 BigQuery Omni 读其他云数据，但计算仍在 GCP 侧 官方文档。 迁出靠导出到 GCS，无跨云复制 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>仅 GCP，无其他云版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云用 BigQuery Omni 读其他云数据，但计算仍在 GCP 侧 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁出靠导出到 GCS，无跨云复制 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (GCP-bound; no cross-cloud). GCP-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. BigQuery Omni reads other clouds&#x27; data, but compute stays GCP-side (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (GCP-bound; no cross-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GCP-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BigQuery Omni reads other clouds&#x27; data, but compute stays GCP-side <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Moving out via GCS export; no cross-cloud replication <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">无行锁概念；并发原语是服务端的 DML 调度：每表最多 2 条并发变异 DML（UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE），超出的排队（上限 20 条），每表每 10 秒最多 25 条 DML 官方文档。 排队超 7 小时未执行或超 20 条排队上限的语句直接失败；内核不重试，重试与削峰由应用负责 官方文档。 热点更新天然被串行化：同一行的…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无行锁概念；并发原语是服务端的 DML 调度：每表最多 2 条并发变异 DML（UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE），超出的排队（上限 20 条），每表每 10 秒最多 25 条 DML <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>排队超 7 小时未执行或超 20 条排队上限的语句直接失败；内核不重试，重试与削峰由应用负责 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>热点更新天然被串行化：同一行的高频 UPDATE 在队列里排队执行，吞吐上限即配额；代价形态是费用而非锁——按需计费下 UPDATE 按&quot;引用列扫描字节+全表所有列字节&quot;计费，宽表热点更新极贵 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>未找到官方命名或文档化的热点行机制的证据；配额/排队系统本身就是限流器，超过即失败而非降级 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>推荐模式是 insert-only 建模 + Storage Write API 流式写入 + 周期性 MERGE 合并；代价是流式写入费用、去重逻辑复杂度与读取侧的短暂不一致窗口 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (mutating DML is queued; the quotas themselves are the throttle). There is no row-lock concept; the concurrency primitive is server-side DML schedulin…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (mutating DML is queued; the quotas themselves are the throttle).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>There is no row-lock concept; the concurrency primitive is server-side DML scheduling: at most 2 concurrent mutating DML statements (UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE) per table, extras queue (up to 20 queued), and at most 25 DML statements per 10 seconds per table <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Statements that wait in the queue over 7 hours or exceed the 20-statement queue limit fail outright; the kernel does not retry — retry and smoothing are the application&#x27;s job <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Hotspot updates are serialized by construction: high-frequency UPDATEs on the same row execute through the queue, so the quotas are the throughput ceiling; the cost shows up as money rather than locks — on-demand UPDATE is billed on &quot;referenced-column scan bytes plus all-column bytes of the table&quot;, making hotspot updates on wide tables very expensive <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>There is no officially named or documented hotspot-row mechanism found; the quota/queue system itself is the throttle — exceeding it fails instead of degrading (to be verified).</li>\n<li>The recommended pattern is insert-only modeling plus the Storage Write API for streaming ingestion plus periodic MERGE consolidation; the cost is streaming-insert charges, deduplication logic complexity, and a brief inconsistency window on the read side <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS_BY_PROJECT/ORGANIZATION：查每次查询的扫描字节、slot 消耗、执行时长，是成本归因的金矿 官方文档。 Cloud Monitoring 指标与告警；控制台有查询计划可视化（执行树、slot 使用）官方文档。 slot 治理靠预留用量视图 + 配额告警；Editions…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS_BY_PROJECT/ORGANIZATION：查每次查询的扫描字节、slot 消耗、执行时长，是成本归因的金矿 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Cloud Monitoring 指标与告警；控制台有查询计划可视化（执行树、slot 使用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>slot 治理靠预留用量视图 + 配额告警；Editions 下&quot;哪个预留被谁占满&quot;是日常问题 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (INFORMATION_SCHEMA + Cloud Monitoring). INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS_BY_PROJECT/ORGANIZATION: per-query bytes scanned, slot consumption and duration — a goldmine fo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (<code>INFORMATION_SCHEMA</code> + Cloud Monitoring).</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS_BY_PROJECT/ORGANIZATION</code>: per-query bytes scanned, slot consumption and duration — a goldmine for cost attribution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud Monitoring metrics and alerts; visual query-plan explorer (execution tree, slot usage) in the console <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Slot governance runs on reservation-usage views plus quota alerts; &quot;which reservation is saturated by whom&quot; is a daily question under Editions <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">以 REST API 为主；官方 JDBC/ODBC 驱动、各语言客户端库齐全，BI 工具直连 官方文档。 Serverless 架构下没有&quot;连接&quot;概念：无连接池打爆问题，并发瓶颈在 slot 而不在连接数 官方文档。 BI Engine：内存加速层，仪表盘类高频小查询走内存，亚秒返回 官方文档。 注意：BI Engine 按内存容量另计…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>以 REST API 为主；官方 JDBC/ODBC 驱动、各语言客户端库齐全，BI 工具直连 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless 架构下没有&quot;连接&quot;概念：无连接池打爆问题，并发瓶颈在 slot 而不在连接数 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BI Engine：内存加速层，仪表盘类高频小查询走内存，亚秒返回 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：BI Engine 按内存容量另计费，不是免费加速 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (REST/JDBC/ODBC + client libraries; no connection concept). REST API first; official JDBC/ODBC drivers and client libraries for all major languages; BI tools co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (REST/JDBC/ODBC + client libraries; no connection concept).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>REST API first; official JDBC/ODBC drivers and client libraries for all major languages; BI tools connect directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No &quot;connection&quot; concept in the serverless architecture: no connection-pool exhaustion — concurrency bottlenecks are slots, not connections <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BI Engine: in-memory acceleration layer giving sub-second dashboard queries <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: BI Engine bills separately by memory capacity — not a free speedup <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">支持多语句事务与 DML（INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE），快照隔离语义 官方文档。 注意：这是分析型事务（ETL 修正、SCD 更新），不是 OLTP；大 DML 的 slot 与时间成本要预估，一次全表 UPDATE 可能很贵（按需模式下按扫描计费）社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>支持多语句事务与 DML（INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE），快照隔离语义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：这是分析型事务（ETL 修正、SCD 更新），不是 OLTP；大 DML 的 slot 与时间成本要预估，一次全表 UPDATE 可能很贵（按需模式下按扫描计费）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (snapshot isolation; analytical DML transactions). Multi-statement transactions and DML (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE) with snapshot-isolation semantics (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (snapshot isolation; analytical DML transactions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multi-statement transactions and DML (<code>INSERT</code>/<code>UPDATE</code>/<code>DELETE</code>/<code>MERGE</code>) with snapshot-isolation semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: these are analytical transactions (ETL corrections, SCD updates), not OLTP — big DMLs carry slot and time cost, and a full-table UPDATE under on-demand billing scans (and bills) the whole table <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">跨区域数据集复制做容灾；存储多副本，计算无状态 官方文档。 Analytics Hub：跨组织/跨项目共享实时数据集，对方订阅即用，无需复制 官方文档。 无跨云主动-主动写：多活是 GCP 区域内的事，跨云靠 Omni 查询而非写入 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>跨区域数据集复制做容灾；存储多副本，计算无状态 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Analytics Hub：跨组织/跨项目共享实时数据集，对方订阅即用，无需复制 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无跨云主动-主动写：多活是 GCP 区域内的事，跨云靠 Omni 查询而非写入 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (cross-region copy + Analytics Hub sharing). Cross-region dataset copy for DR; multi-replica storage with stateless compute <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Analytics Hub: shar…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (cross-region copy + Analytics Hub sharing).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cross-region dataset copy for DR; multi-replica storage with stateless compute <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Analytics Hub: share live datasets across organizations/projects — subscribers consume directly, no copying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No cross-cloud active-active writes: multi-region liveness is a GCP-region affair; cross-cloud is about querying via Omni, not writing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">全 Serverless：查询自动分配 slot，用户无节点概念，不用调集群大小 官方文档。 Editions 下可设 baseline/max 做自动扩缩，baseline 可为 0（纯按需扩缩）官方文档。 边缘真相：自动扩缩按&quot;分配&quot;而非&quot;使用&quot;计费，60 秒起步——一个 10 秒的查询也占 1 分钟 slot；slot 争抢会导致查…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>全 Serverless：查询自动分配 slot，用户无节点概念，不用调集群大小 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Editions 下可设 baseline/max 做自动扩缩，baseline 可为 0（纯按需扩缩）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘真相：自动扩缩按&quot;分配&quot;而非&quot;使用&quot;计费，60 秒起步——一个 10 秒的查询也占 1 分钟 slot；slot 争抢会导致查询排队，Standard 版有 slot 上限 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (serverless auto-scaling; slot-reservation governance). Fully serverless: queries auto-allocate slots, no node concept, no cluster sizing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Under…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (serverless auto-scaling; slot-reservation governance).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully serverless: queries auto-allocate slots, no node concept, no cluster sizing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Under Editions, baseline/max autoscaling is configurable with baseline allowed at 0 (pure on-demand scaling) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Edge truth: autoscaling bills on slots <em>allocated</em>, not <em>used</em>, with a 60-second minimum — a 10-second query occupies a full minute of slots; slot contention queues queries, and Standard has a slot cap <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。commitlog 可加密（transparent_data_encryption_options）；SSTable 落盘加密在开源版查证为无（该能力历史上保留给 DataStax Enterprise）；备份（nodetool snapshot）无内置加密，依赖对象存储服务端加密<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。 S…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。commitlog 可加密（<code>transparent_data_encryption_options</code>）；<strong>SSTable 落盘加密在开源版查证为无</strong>（该能力历史上保留给 DataStax Enterprise）；备份（nodetool snapshot）无内置加密，依赖对象存储服务端加密<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong>（官方文档/官方博客）。统一版本包含原企业版的落盘加密；Cloud 版支持数据库级加密（AES-128/256，用户表 + commitlog + batchlog + hint 均加密，支持 AWS/GCP KMS 客户主密钥）；自建版 KMS 集成细节待验证。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The commitlog can be encrypted (transparent_data_encryption_options); SSTable data-at-rest encryption is confirmed absent …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The commitlog can be encrypted (<code>transparent_data_encryption_options</code>); <strong>SSTable data-at-rest encryption is confirmed absent in the open-source edition</strong> (that capability was historically reserved for DataStax Enterprise); backups (nodetool snapshot) have no built-in encryption and rely on object-store server-side encryption <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> (official docs / official blog). The unified release includes what was formerly the enterprise edition&#x27;s data-at-rest encryption; the Cloud edition supports database-level encryption (AES-128/256, encrypting user tables + commitlog + batchlog + hints, with AWS/GCP KMS customer master keys); self-hosted KMS integration details to-be-verified.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：client_encryption_options（客户端↔节点）与 server_encryption_options（节点间，internode_encryption: all/dc/none）；5.0 新增 mTLS 证书认证（官方发布口径）。ScyllaDB：同等 client/server 加…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：<code>client_encryption_options</code>（客户端↔节点）与 <code>server_encryption_options</code>（节点间，<code>internode_encryption: all/dc/none</code>）；5.0 新增 <strong>mTLS 证书认证</strong>（官方发布口径）。ScyllaDB：同等 client/server 加密选项，支持证书认证（<code>CertificateAuthenticator</code>，社区实测）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: client_encryption_options (client↔node) and server_encryption_options (internode, internode_encryption: all/dc/none); 5.0 adds mTLS …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: <code>client_encryption_options</code> (client↔node) and <code>server_encryption_options</code> (internode, <code>internode_encryption: all/dc/none</code>); 5.0 adds <strong>mTLS certificate authentication</strong> (official release claim). ScyllaDB: equivalent client/server encryption options with certificate authentication support (<code>CertificateAuthenticator</code>, community-tested).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL（类 SQL 但无 join/子查询/任意 WHERE）；多语言官方驱动；Spark/Hadoop 连接器；ScyllaDB 额外兼容 Amazon DynamoDB API（Alternator），DynamoDB 应用可低改迁移（官方口径）。Cassandra 5.0 新增 SAI 与向量索引，补…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL（类 SQL 但无 join/子查询/任意 WHERE）；多语言官方驱动；Spark/Hadoop 连接器；<strong>ScyllaDB 额外兼容 Amazon DynamoDB API（Alternator）</strong>，DynamoDB 应用可低改迁移（官方口径）。Cassandra 5.0 新增 SAI 与向量索引，补齐部分二级索引/相似检索场景。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (official docs / community consensus). CQL (SQL-like but no joins/subqueries/arbitrary WHERE); official drivers in multiple languages; Spark/Hadoop co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). CQL (SQL-like but no joins/subqueries/arbitrary WHERE); official drivers in multiple languages; Spark/Hadoop connectors; <strong>ScyllaDB additionally supports the Amazon DynamoDB API (Alternator)</strong>, so DynamoDB applications can migrate with minimal changes <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Cassandra 5.0 adds SAI and vector indexing, filling in some secondary-index / similarity-search scenarios.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra：Apache</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：Apache 2.0 纯开源；商业围绕服务与托管：DataStax（DSE 企业版、Astra DB Serverless 按读写请求量计费）2025 年 5 月被 IBM 收购并入 watsonx.data（公开报道）；另有 K8ssandra 等云原生发行版。 ScyllaDB：2025.1 起 source-av…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>Apache 2.0 纯开源</strong>；商业围绕服务与托管：DataStax（DSE 企业版、Astra DB Serverless 按读写请求量计费）<strong>2025 年 5 月被 IBM 收购</strong>并入 watsonx.data（公开报道）；另有 K8ssandra 等云原生发行版。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>2025.1 起 source-available 统一版本</strong>（官方公告 2024-12）；免费额度为<strong>每组织 10TB 配置磁盘 + 50 vCPU</strong>（跨所有集群，官方 FAQ 口径），超出需商业许可；6.2 AGPL 为最后一个纯开源版本；托管为 ScyllaDB Cloud / X Cloud（按节点/资源计费模型，具体单价以官网为准，此处不引用）。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra: Apach</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Apache 2.0, pure open source; commercial activity centers on services and managed offerings: DataStax (DSE enterprise edition, Astra DB serverless billed per r…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Apache 2.0, pure open source</strong>; commercial activity centers on services and managed offerings: DataStax (DSE enterprise edition, Astra DB serverless billed per read/write request) <strong>was acquired by IBM in May 2025</strong> and folded into watsonx.data (public reporting); there are also cloud-native distributions such as K8ssandra.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Source-available unified release since 2025.1</strong> (official announcement, 2024-12); the free tier is <strong>10TB of provisioned disk + 50 vCPU per organization</strong> (across all clusters, per official FAQ), with commercial licensing required beyond that; AGPL 6.2 was the last purely open-source release; managed offerings are ScyllaDB Cloud / X Cloud (per-node/resource billing model; exact pricing per the official site — not quoted here).</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra 中等</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra 中等（官方文档以英文为主；CSDN/博客中文教程多，但大量内容停留在 3.x/4.0 时代）；ScyllaDB 较少（官方英文文档为主，中文社区内容稀缺）——均为社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Cassandra <strong>中等</strong>（官方文档以英文为主；CSDN/博客中文教程多，但大量内容停留在 3.x/4.0 时代）；ScyllaDB <strong>较少</strong>（官方英文文档为主，中文社区内容稀缺）——均为社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra is moder</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra is moderate (official docs are primarily English; many CSDN/blog Chinese tutorials exist but much of the content is stuck in the 3.x/4.0 era); ScyllaDB is spars…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Cassandra is <strong>moderate</strong> (official docs are primarily English; many CSDN/blog Chinese tutorials exist but much of the content is stuck in the 3.x/4.0 era); ScyllaDB is <strong>sparse</strong> (official English docs dominate; Chinese community content is scarce) — both per community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（写吞吐随节点扩展的标杆；读看调优）。 Cassandra：加节点即加写吞吐，调优得当单集群百万写入/秒量级（视硬件，社区实测）社区实测。 ScyllaDB（C++ 重写）官方称单节点数倍于 Cassandra<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；seastar 分片-per-core 架构 厂商口径。 读 P99 取决于 compaction 策略与布隆过滤…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（写吞吐随节点扩展的标杆；读看调优）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra：加节点即加写吞吐，调优得当单集群百万写入/秒量级（视硬件，社区实测）<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB（C++ 重写）官方称单节点数倍于 Cassandra<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；seastar 分片-per-core 架构 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>读 P99 取决于 compaction 策略与布隆过滤器调优；跨数据中心复制延迟可配 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (the benchmark for write throughput that scales with node count; reads depend on tuning). Cassandra: add nodes to add write throughput; well-tuned single cluste…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (the benchmark for write throughput that scales with node count; reads depend on tuning).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra: add nodes to add write throughput; well-tuned single clusters reach millions of writes/sec (hardware-dependent, community-tested) <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB (C++ rewrite) claims multiple-x per-node vs Cassandra <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>; seastar shard-per-core architecture <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Read P99 depends on compaction strategy and Bloom-filter tuning; cross-DC replication latency is tunable <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（开源无官方认证；企业版各走各）。 Apache Cassandra 开源版：无官方合规认证 社区共识。 DataStax Enterprise / ScyllaDB 企业版各自持有企业合规资质<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 云厂商托管版继承云厂商资质 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（开源无官方认证；企业版各走各）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apache Cassandra 开源版：无官方合规认证 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>DataStax Enterprise / ScyllaDB 企业版各自持有企业合规资质<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>云厂商托管版继承云厂商资质 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (no official certs for open source; enterprise editions differ). Apache Cassandra open source: no official compliance certs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Dat…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (no official certs for open source; enterprise editions differ).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apache Cassandra open source: no official compliance certs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>DataStax Enterprise / ScyllaDB enterprise editions hold their own enterprise qualifications <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud-managed editions inherit provider qualifications <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Cassandra 2008 开源；ScyllaDB 2016 开源）。 Cassandra：2008 年 Facebook 开源，2010 年 Apache 毕业；老牌分布式宽列 社区共识。 ScyllaDB：2015 年成立，C++ 重写，DynamoDB 兼容是差异化 社区共识。 两者社区都活跃，但新增项目热度不如向量/Serv…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Cassandra 2008 开源；ScyllaDB 2016 开源）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra：2008 年 Facebook 开源，2010 年 Apache 毕业；老牌分布式宽列 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB：2015 年成立，C++ 重写，DynamoDB 兼容是差异化 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>两者社区都活跃，但新增项目热度不如向量/Serverless 新贵 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Cassandra open-sourced 2008; ScyllaDB 2016). Cassandra: open-sourced by Facebook 2008, Apache graduated 2010; the veteran distributed wide-column store (commun…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Cassandra open-sourced 2008; ScyllaDB 2016).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra: open-sourced by Facebook 2008, Apache graduated 2010; the veteran distributed wide-column store <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB: founded 2015, C++ rewrite; DynamoDB compatibility is the differentiator <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Both communities active, but new-project buzz trails vector/serverless upstarts <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Netflix、Apple、Discord）。 Netflix、Apple、Discord 等公开大规模用户 社区共识。 Discord 从 Cassandra 迁到 ScyllaDB 是著名案例（公开博客）社区共识。 国内大厂（字节/快手等）有规模化使用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Netflix、Apple、Discord）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Netflix、Apple、Discord 等公开大规模用户 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Discord 从 Cassandra 迁到 ScyllaDB 是著名案例（公开博客）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>国内大厂（字节/快手等）有规模化使用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Netflix, Apple, Discord). Public hyperscale users: Netflix, Apple, Discord <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Discord&#x27;s Cassandra-to-ScyllaDB migration is a famous public …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Netflix, Apple, Discord).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public hyperscale users: Netflix, Apple, Discord <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Discord&#x27;s Cassandra-to-ScyllaDB migration is a famous public case <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Scaled use at Chinese hyperscalers (ByteDance/Kuaishou etc.) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Medusa 备份；sstableloader 迁移）。 备份：nodetool snapshot；Medusa（Spotify 开源，S3 备份编排）社区共识。 迁移：sstableloader；ScyllaDB 有 DynamoDB/Cassandra 迁移工具 社区共识。 CDC：Debezium Cassandra 连接器；监…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Medusa 备份；sstableloader 迁移）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>备份：nodetool snapshot；Medusa（Spotify 开源，S3 备份编排）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>迁移：sstableloader；ScyllaDB 有 DynamoDB/Cassandra 迁移工具 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>CDC：Debezium Cassandra 连接器；监控：JMX exporter <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Medusa backup; sstableloader migration). Backup: nodetool snapshot; Medusa (Spotify-open-sourced S3 backup orchestration) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Migration: sst…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Medusa backup; sstableloader migration).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup: nodetool snapshot; Medusa (Spotify-open-sourced S3 backup orchestration) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Migration: sstableloader; ScyllaDB ships DynamoDB/Cassandra migration tools <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>CDC: Debezium Cassandra connector; monitoring: JMX exporter <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Astra Serverless；ScyllaDB Cloud）。 DataStax Astra：Serverless 按量 厂商口径。 ScyllaDB Cloud：托管 ScyllaDB 厂商口径。 各云也有 Keyspaces 等兼容托管 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Astra Serverless；ScyllaDB Cloud）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DataStax Astra：Serverless 按量 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB Cloud：托管 ScyllaDB <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>各云也有 Keyspaces 等兼容托管 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Astra serverless; ScyllaDB Cloud). DataStax Astra: serverless pay-per-use <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. ScyllaDB Cloud: managed ScyllaDB <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Compatible managed o…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Astra serverless; ScyllaDB Cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DataStax Astra: serverless pay-per-use <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB Cloud: managed ScyllaDB <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Compatible managed options on clouds (e.g. Keyspaces) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（DSBulk/sstableloader；cqlsh COPY 只适合小数据）。 DSBulk（DataStax Bulk Loader）是生产级批量导入/导出工具 官方文档。 sstableloader 可直接加载 SSTable（ScyllaDB 同理）官方文档。 cqlsh COPY 单线程慢只适合小表；大宽行注意超时 社区共识…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（DSBulk/sstableloader；cqlsh COPY 只适合小数据）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DSBulk（DataStax Bulk Loader）是生产级批量导入/导出工具 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>sstableloader 可直接加载 SSTable（ScyllaDB 同理）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>cqlsh COPY 单线程慢只适合小表；大宽行注意超时 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (DSBulk/sstableloader; cqlsh COPY for small data only). DSBulk (DataStax Bulk Loader) is the production-grade bulk import/export tool <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. sstablelo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (DSBulk/sstableloader; cqlsh COPY for small data only).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DSBulk (DataStax Bulk Loader) is the production-grade bulk import/export tool <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>sstableloader can load SSTables directly (same for ScyllaDB) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>cqlsh COPY is single-threaded and slow, small tables only; watch timeouts on wide rows <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：有（官方文档，4.0+）。audit_logging_options：按节点落文件的审计日志，类别含 QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE，支持 keyspace/用户过滤，可运行时经 nodetool 开关；堆内存与磁盘占用有界（官方口径）。 ScyllaDB：有（官方仓库代码/社…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>有</strong>（官方文档，4.0+）。<code>audit_logging_options</code>：按节点落文件的审计日志，类别含 QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE，支持 keyspace/用户过滤，可运行时经 nodetool 开关；堆内存与磁盘占用有界（官方口径）。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong>（官方仓库代码/社区论坛）。audit 子系统支持输出到 syslog 或 <code>audit.audit_log</code> 表，类别 QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ADMIN，可按 keyspace/table 选择性审计，密码脱敏；原为企业版能力，2025 年初已合并入统一代码库。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Supported (official docs, 4.0+). audit_logging_options: per-node file-based audit logs with categories QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE, keyspace/user filt…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Supported</strong> (official docs, 4.0+). <code>audit_logging_options</code>: per-node file-based audit logs with categories QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE, keyspace/user filtering, and runtime on/off via nodetool; heap-memory and disk usage are bounded <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> (official repo code / community forums). The audit subsystem outputs to syslog or the <code>audit.audit_log</code> table, with categories QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ADMIN, selective auditing by keyspace/table, and password redaction; formerly an enterprise-edition capability, merged into the unified codebase in early 2025.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无外部表；靠 Spark Connector 做分析侧联邦）。 CQL 无外部表/联邦查询语义 社区共识。 Spark Cassandra Connector 可把 C* 当数据源做离线分析 官方文档。 ScyllaDB 兼容同一套连接器 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无外部表；靠 Spark Connector 做分析侧联邦）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CQL 无外部表/联邦查询语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Spark Cassandra Connector 可把 C* 当数据源做离线分析 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB 兼容同一套连接器 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (No external tables; Spark Connector for analytics-side federation). CQL has no external-table/federated-query semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Spark …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (No external tables; Spark Connector for analytics-side federation).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CQL has no external-table/federated-query semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Spark Cassandra Connector exposes C* as a data source for offline analytics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB is compatible with the same connectors <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Scylla CDC 日志表；C* 4.0+ CDC；Debezium）。 ScyllaDB：按表开启 CDC，变更写入专用日志表供消费 官方文档。 Cassandra 4.0+：cdc_enabled 提交日志式 CDC，需自行消费 官方文档。 Debezium 有 Cassandra/Scylla 连接器（社区成熟度不一）社区共识…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Scylla CDC 日志表；C* 4.0+ CDC；Debezium）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：按表开启 CDC，变更写入专用日志表供消费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Cassandra 4.0+：cdc_enabled 提交日志式 CDC，需自行消费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Debezium 有 Cassandra/Scylla 连接器（社区成熟度不一）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Scylla CDC log tables; C* 4.0+ CDC; Debezium). ScyllaDB: per-table CDC writes changes to dedicated log tables for consumption <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra 4.0+: …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Scylla CDC log tables; C* 4.0+ CDC; Debezium).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: per-table CDC writes changes to dedicated log tables for consumption <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cassandra 4.0+: commitlog-based CDC via cdc_enabled, self-consumed <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Debezium has Cassandra/Scylla connectors (community maturity varies) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（列级/表级原生 TTL，写入时指定）。 INSERT/UPDATE 可带 USING TTL（列级过期），表级 default_time_to_live 官方文档。 过期数据靠 compaction 回收，墓碑（tombstone）堆积会拖慢读 社区共识。 TTL 重度场景建议调小 gc_grace_seconds 并监控 tombs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（列级/表级原生 TTL，写入时指定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>INSERT/UPDATE 可带 USING TTL（列级过期），表级 default_time_to_live <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>过期数据靠 compaction 回收，墓碑（tombstone）堆积会拖慢读 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>TTL 重度场景建议调小 gc_grace_seconds 并监控 tombstone 比例 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native column-/table-level TTL set at write time). INSERT/UPDATE accept USING TTL per column; default_time_to_live per table <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Expired data is r…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native column-/table-level TTL set at write time).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>INSERT/UPDATE accept USING TTL per column; default_time_to_live per table <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Expired data is reclaimed by compaction; tombstone buildup hurts read performance <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>For TTL-heavy workloads lower gc_grace_seconds and watch tombstone ratios <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（加列轻量但 schema 变更最终一致）。 此处的 schema 演进即 CQL 的 ALTER TABLE：加列/删列属&quot;只改定义不碰数据&quot;类，官方文档明确为常量时间操作，不重写数据 官方文档。 主键/聚簇键建表后永远不可改，改需重建表导数据（&quot;搬数据&quot;类，但无在线路径） 官方文档。 删列内容在 compaction 时懒删除…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（加列轻量但 schema 变更最终一致）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>此处的 schema 演进即 CQL 的 ALTER TABLE：加列/删列属&quot;只改定义不碰数据&quot;类，官方文档明确为常量时间操作，不重写数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>主键/聚簇键建表后永远不可改，改需重建表导数据（&quot;搬数据&quot;类，但无在线路径） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>删列内容在 compaction 时懒删除；删列后重建同名列允许，除非原列是非 frozen 的集合类型 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>schema 变更经 gossip 在集群内最终一致传播：混合版本期读写可能异常，并发 DDL 可能导致 schema 不一致，生产变更后用 nodetool describecluster 确认各节点 schema 一致 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB 的 schema 变更做了 Raft 化改进，一致性更好 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>语义注记：CQL 没有 CHECK/外键/默认值约束，ADD 列不校验已有数据，&quot;验证约束&quot;类在此系统基本缺席 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Lightweight add-column but eventually-consistent schema changes). Schema evolution here means CQL ALTER TABLE: adding or dropping a column is the &quot;de…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Lightweight add-column but eventually-consistent schema changes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Schema evolution here means CQL ALTER TABLE: adding or dropping a column is the &quot;definition-only&quot; class — officially a constant-time operation that rewrites no data <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Primary/clustering keys can never be altered after creation; changing them means rebuilding the table and migrating data (the &quot;move data&quot; class, with no online path) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Dropped column contents are removed lazily during compaction; re-adding a same-name column is allowed unless it was a non-frozen collection <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Schema changes propagate through the cluster via gossip with eventual consistency: mixed-version reads/writes can misbehave, and concurrent DDLs can cause schema disagreement — verify agreement with nodetool describecluster after production changes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB moved schema changes onto Raft, improving consistency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Semantics note: CQL has no CHECK/foreign-key/default constraints, and ADD never validates existing data — the &quot;validate constraints&quot; class is essentially absent here <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Many restrictions (e.g. no re-adding a dropped column name); schema evolution is constrained <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB Raft-ified schema changes for better consistency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（keyspace 逻辑隔离；无资源限流）。 keyspace 做逻辑隔离，但无 CPU/IO 限流，一个租户可拖慢全集群 社区共识。 ScyllaDB 有 workload 优先级调度，比开源 Cassandra 好一些 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（keyspace 逻辑隔离；无资源限流）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>keyspace 做逻辑隔离，但无 CPU/IO 限流，一个租户可拖慢全集群 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB 有 workload 优先级调度，比开源 Cassandra 好一些 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Keyspace logical isolation; no resource throttling). Keyspaces isolate logically, but with no CPU/IO throttling one tenant can slow the whole cluster (community …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Keyspace logical isolation; no resource throttling).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keyspaces isolate logically, but with no CPU/IO throttling one tenant can slow the whole cluster <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB adds workload-priority scheduling, better than open-source Cassandra <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（多 DC 原生，副本策略跨机房）。 NetworkTopologyStrategy 按 DC 放副本，天然跨地域 官方文档。 LOCAL_QUORUM 就近读写，EACH_QUORUM 强一致但延迟高 官方文档。 跨区延迟直接加到写路径，机房间网络质量决定体验 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（多 DC 原生，副本策略跨机房）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>NetworkTopologyStrategy 按 DC 放副本，天然跨地域 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>LOCAL_QUORUM 就近读写，EACH_QUORUM 强一致但延迟高 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区延迟直接加到写路径，机房间网络质量决定体验 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native multi-DC; replica strategy spans sites). NetworkTopologyStrategy places replicas per DC — cross-region by design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. LOCAL_QUORUM for local…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native multi-DC; replica strategy spans sites).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>NetworkTopologyStrategy places replicas per DC — cross-region by design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>LOCAL_QUORUM for local reads/writes; EACH_QUORUM for strong consistency at high latency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-region latency lands directly on the write path; inter-DC network quality decides the experience <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（无单点；节点故障自动绕过）。 对等架构无主节点，单节点故障客户端自动绕过，RTO≈0（读/写按一致性级别降级）官方文档。 RPO 取决于一致性级别，ONE 级别可能丢数 官方文档。 hinted handoff + 修复保障最终一致 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（无单点；节点故障自动绕过）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对等架构无主节点，单节点故障客户端自动绕过，RTO≈0（读/写按一致性级别降级）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RPO 取决于一致性级别，ONE 级别可能丢数 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>hinted handoff + 修复保障最终一致 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (No single point; failed nodes bypassed automatically). Peer architecture has no primary; clients bypass failed nodes automatically — RTO≈0 (reads/writes degrad…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (No single point; failed nodes bypassed automatically).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Peer architecture has no primary; clients bypass failed nodes automatically — RTO≈0 (reads/writes degrade per consistency level) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RPO follows the consistency level; ONE can lose data <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Hinted handoff + repair ensure eventual consistency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（无原生行级安全与脱敏）。 Cassandra / ScyllaDB 无原生行级安全与动态脱敏 社区共识 权限只到 keyspace / table 级，无列级权限 官方文档 行级隔离靠应用层或不同 keyspace 物理隔离 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（无原生行级安全与脱敏）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra / ScyllaDB 无原生行级安全与动态脱敏 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>权限只到 keyspace / table 级，无列级权限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>行级隔离靠应用层或不同 keyspace 物理隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No native RLS/masking). Cassandra / ScyllaDB has no native row-level security or dynamic masking <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> Privileges stop at keyspace / table …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No native RLS/masking).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra / ScyllaDB has no native row-level security or dynamic masking <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Privileges stop at keyspace / table level; no column-level privileges <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Row isolation relies on the app layer or physical isolation across keyspaces <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（集合类型；JSON 文本存取）。 CQL 有 map/list/set 集合类型，可表达嵌套结构 官方文档。 无原生 JSON 类型；ScyllaDB 支持 INSERT/SELECT JSON 语法糖，底层仍为文本/集合 官方文档。 集合过大导致分区膨胀，生产建议控制元素数量 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（集合类型；JSON 文本存取）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CQL 有 map/list/set 集合类型，可表达嵌套结构 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生 JSON 类型；ScyllaDB 支持 INSERT/SELECT JSON 语法糖，底层仍为文本/集合 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>集合过大导致分区膨胀，生产建议控制元素数量 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Collections; JSON as text). CQL map/list/set collections express nested structures <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native JSON type; ScyllaDB offers INSERT/SELECT JSON synta…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Collections; JSON as text).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CQL map/list/set collections express nested structures <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native JSON type; ScyllaDB offers INSERT/SELECT JSON syntax over text/collections <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Oversized collections bloat partitions; keep element counts bounded <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（SASI 非分词；生产多外挂 ES）。 SASI 二级索引支持前缀/contains 匹配，但非分词全文检索 官方文档。 生产全文场景普遍外挂 ES/Solr，数据双写一致性自负 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（SASI 非分词；生产多外挂 ES）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SASI 二级索引支持前缀/contains 匹配，但非分词全文检索 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>生产全文场景普遍外挂 ES/Solr，数据双写一致性自负 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (SASI is not tokenized; ES common). SASI secondary indexes do prefix/contains matching, not tokenized full-text <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Production full-text usually offl…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (SASI is not tokenized; ES common).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SASI secondary indexes do prefix/contains matching, not tokenized full-text <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Production full-text usually offloads to ES/Solr; dual-write consistency is on you <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：PasswordAuthenticator + CassandraAuthorizer，CQL GRANT/REVOKE 的 RBAC（keyspace/table 级），角色可嵌套；Kerberos/LDAP 为 DSE 企业版能力（开源版查证为无）。ScyllaDB：密码认证 + 角色权限（与 CQ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：<code>PasswordAuthenticator</code> + <code>CassandraAuthorizer</code>，CQL <code>GRANT/REVOKE</code> 的 RBAC（keyspace/table 级），角色可嵌套；Kerberos/LDAP 为 DSE 企业版能力（开源版查证为无）。ScyllaDB：密码认证 + 角色权限（与 CQL 语义一致）+ <strong>LDAP/AD 集成</strong>（原企业版，现统一版本包含，官方发布口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: PasswordAuthenticator + CassandraAuthorizer, CQL GRANT/REVOKE RBAC (keyspace/table level) with nestable roles; Kerberos/LDAP are DSE…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: <code>PasswordAuthenticator</code> + <code>CassandraAuthorizer</code>, CQL <code>GRANT/REVOKE</code> RBAC (keyspace/table level) with nestable roles; Kerberos/LDAP are DSE enterprise-edition capabilities (confirmed absent in the open-source edition). ScyllaDB: password authentication + role-based authorization (same CQL semantics) + <strong>LDAP/AD integration</strong> (formerly enterprise, now included in the unified release, per official release announcements).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（LSM+SSTable 压缩；写放大显著）。 LSM 架构下 SSTable 支持多种压缩（LZ4/Snappy/Deflate/ZSTD），压缩比高。官方文档 LSM 写放大（compaction 反复重写）是存储效率的主要损耗，需调优压缩策略与 compaction。社区实测 ScyllaDB 的分片-per-core 架构减少 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（LSM+SSTable 压缩；写放大显著）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>LSM 架构下 SSTable 支持多种压缩（LZ4/Snappy/Deflate/ZSTD），压缩比高。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>LSM 写放大（compaction 反复重写）是存储效率的主要损耗，需调优压缩策略与 compaction。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>ScyllaDB 的分片-per-core 架构减少 compaction 抖动，压缩效率更稳定。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (LSM plus SSTable compression; notable write amplification). Under LSM architecture, SSTables support multiple compressors (LZ4/Snappy/Deflate/ZSTD) with high r…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (LSM plus SSTable compression; notable write amplification).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Under LSM architecture, SSTables support multiple compressors (LZ4/Snappy/Deflate/ZSTD) with high ratios. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>LSM write amplification (compaction repeatedly rewriting data) is the main storage-efficiency cost; compression strategy and compaction need tuning. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>ScyllaDB&#x27;s shard-per-core architecture reduces compaction jitter for more stable compression efficiency. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（Cassandra 开源；ScyllaDB 双版本）。 Apache Cassandra 为 Apache 2.0 社区开源，无协议变更黑历史。官方文档 ScyllaDB 采用开源/企业双版本策略，企业版部分高级特性闭源，存在功能分层。厂商口径 两者协议兼容（CQL），生态可互替，锁定风险低。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（Cassandra 开源；ScyllaDB 双版本）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apache Cassandra 为 Apache 2.0 社区开源，无协议变更黑历史。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ScyllaDB 采用开源/企业双版本策略，企业版部分高级特性闭源，存在功能分层。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>两者协议兼容（CQL），生态可互替，锁定风险低。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cassandra open; ScyllaDB dual-edition). Apache Cassandra is community open source under Apache 2.0 with no license-change history. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> ScyllaDB uses …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cassandra open; ScyllaDB dual-edition).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Apache Cassandra is community open source under Apache 2.0 with no license-change history. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>ScyllaDB uses an open-source/enterprise dual-edition strategy, with some advanced features closed in the enterprise edition — a feature-tier split. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Both speak CQL and are ecosystem-interchangeable, keeping lock-in risk low. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});